# The graph of a point of point: a Scott sum of two constructors, in order:
# cyclic, whose fields are the shape (a constructor of schema/graph_shape)
# and the size (a decimal text), and tree, the infinite binary tree, whose
# fields are the order of its branches (a constructor of
# empty_set_reachability/order), the branches kept (a constructor of
# empty_set_reachability/branches) and the target's bits (a list of decimal
# texts). Read by its position
# (com.yang_bo.gezi.contest.corpora.reductions.EmptySetReachability, graphOf, into
# ReachabilityGraph).
λ export
. export
  (λshape size cyclic tree. cyclic shape size) λorder branches bits cyclic tree. tree order branches bits
